{"author":{"id":"686d9350e5e426946f54ca7a73ceeef9fd8682b44ea6617ce58187e451c43768"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790696151,"nonce":"B4rkOXuNkxt0IPtj4BKQiLfDtIs=","title":"Keep hlwgpu releases synchronized with xgpu","message":"Add release guards for the invariants that are currently maintained by hand: xgpu-core, xgpu-backend, and xgpu-bindgen must use one revision; advancing that revision must regenerate a clean committed haxe/gpu package; haxelib.json must agree with a versioned release tag; and release notes must identify the WebGPU IDL snapshot carried by the pinned xgpu revision.\n\nThe legacy crates/hlwgpu/spec/webgpu.idl file must not be treated as the public coverage source. A failed invariant should stop CI or release publication with an actionable message.","files":null}]}